  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T07:39:15.413685+00:00",
  "source": "https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~odlyzko/doc/metcalfe.pdf",
  "reference": "Metcalfe B. Metcalfe's Law After 40 Years of Ethernet. IEEE Computer. 2013;46(12):26-31."
